[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]

; Counting with the Counting Man (scripts/ui/count_screen.gd): a dim, a
; parchment panel, one line, a grid of coins the script fills, and the
; button that stops it. No number is on this screen until the end line says
; the total in words. Twelve columns of 64 px coins fit the 1080 portrait
; viewport with room to spare; the panel grows to its content.

